<title>UK: WestLB unit sets 200 million rand three-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB unit sets 200 million rand three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WestMerchant.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE CURACAO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTLB GZ</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.25     MATURITY    07.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p> NOTES    **SA/UK/US/DE/NLANTS</p>
<p>		DIRECT,  UNECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
